rise. Produce one rigorous, readable technical report in Markdown. Preserve epistemic statuses exactly: adopted architecture, archived proposal, mathematical theorem, conjecture, operational interpretation, and literary metaphor must never be collapsed. Treat the supplied corpus as evidence, not as automatically true. You have no tools and may use only this packet.ÉdpairÉhconstantÇdbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;NfHIRJ_Zr4djWs4uYk6Xiw0e9Oo7EO0EGKoifGI1nQUÉdpairÉerightÅdunitÉerightÅdunitÉerightÅdunitÉerightÅdunitÉerightÅdunitÉerightÅdunitÉdleftÅdstarÅdunitÇdmarkfsystemÉdpairÉhconstantÇdbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;QKG8jBr63_JV4xrqyziIA3pORX4GPyNXfCHI8yN3Dr4ÉdpairÉdleftÅdstarÉcsumÅdunitÉcsumÅdunitÉcsumÅdunitÉcsumÅdunitÉcsumÅdunitÉcsumÅdunitÅdunitÇdmark`ÉdpairÉhconstantÇdbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;6vr4UjpS1EPYlmT567HKWB2RxStnES6HZW7n4cEvb7MÉdpairÉerightÅdunitÉerightÅdunitÉerightÅdunitÉerightÅdunitÉerightÅdunitÉerightÅdunitÉdleftÅdstarÅdunitÇdmarkz␀÷¨
