6. **Finite do-calculus on causal sets** ‚Äî confounded triangle,
   back-door as section existence.
7. **Constructive Kolmogorov on the hull** ‚Äî normalization-as-
   compactification, with `tower_gluing_dichotomy` as the proved seed.

After 1‚Äì3, ¬ß7c's free-probability item stands on real ground:
non-crossing partitions for the defect gas over an actual measure.
Honest gaps: almost-sure statements at full strength wait on more
Bishop-real machinery; characteristic functions wait on ¬ß9's ‚ÑÇ-from-the-
quarter-turn. Nothing above needs either to start. Discipline: Doob,
Kolmogorov, Pearl remain unearned names (¬ß10 ledger) until the welds are
