- Readings, not theorems: the `Quark.lean` Œ∂ with Œ∂¬≤ = Œ∂ ‚àí 1 is the
  Eisenstein-integer unit; in ‚Ñ§[Œ∂] the prime 3 ramifies, 2 is inert,
