## 12d. Charge conservation and the shrouded collapse (proved, 2026-07-11 night)

The stable-particle theorem, in `AperiodicOrder/Defect.lean` (extending
the owning module), all zero-axiom except where noted. The developed
frame of any walk is iterated rotation by the walk's total turn count
(`develop_fst_eq_rotPow_sum`) and composes along concatenation
(`develop_fst_append`) ‚Äî straight segments are invisible to the frame.
The turn counts act through the frame orbit (`FrameMem`, the rot-orbit of
the base frame), on which the derived rotation has order six
(`rotPow_six_of_frameMem` ‚Äî the ONE decided primitive; everything else
derives from it: seven-cone = one excess quantum, U-turn pair = full
frame). Consequences: a based walk's frame closes iff its turn count is a
multiple of six (`develop_frame_closed_iff`); **the coordination census**
(`cone_frame_closed_iff`: a k-site is frame-flat iff 6 ‚à£ k ‚Äî flat IS
hexagonal coordination); **the neutral sectors**
(`coneConfig_frame_closed_iff`: a configuration of cones is frame-flat
iff its total coordination ‚â° 0 mod 6 ‚Äî the superselection rule;
`five_seven_annihilate` is the [5,7] instance); dipoles are frame-neutral
at every separation because their charge word cancels
(`dipole_frame_neutral` ‚Äî deficit against excess, half-turn against
half-turn), so the slide dynamics ‚Äî which edits only straight segments ‚Äî
conserves the rotational charge along the whole descent: an unpaired
five-site keeps its one quantum at every slide stage
(`unpaired_frame_invariant`), never closes, and is annihilated only by an
opposite cone, at any separation (`seven_neutralizes_unpaired`). Capstone
`unpaired_disclination_survives_descent` (propext via the inherited
`slide_collapse` component only): the collapse discharges all
translational content while the rotational quantum sits at its floor ‚Äî
the operator's "shrouded collapse": annihilation runs to a conserved
remainder, not to nothing. With ¬ß7c this gives the territory TWO
independent protection mechanisms ‚Äî topological (frame group) and
logical (diagonalization) ‚Äî and matter species classify by which
protects them.

Method note (operator-directed, generalize it): the first draft proved
conservation through literals (turn count 18, period arithmetic mod 6¬∑k)
and the operator ordered the literals replaced by the structure they
stand for. The repair: ONE decided primitive (order six on the orbit),
everything else derived; 18 disappeared entirely into the cancellation of
the dipole's charge word. When a proof leans on a numeral, ask what
group-theoretic fact the numeral shadows.

Pitfalls that cost time: `rw` with an iff lemma silently costs propext ‚Äî
transport iffs by explicit witness-passing (`Eq.trans` on the witness
equality), never `rw`/`‚ñ∏` (the `‚ñ∏` motive can also grab the wrong
occurrences); literal `+6`/`6*k` arithmetic reduces DEFINITIONALLY (Nat
add/mul recurse on the second argument), so orbit-period inductions need
zero Nat lemmas ‚Äî and core `Nat.add_comm`/`add_assoc`/`zero_add` are
clean anyway, unlike the min/max family. Operational: parallel sessions
running `make build` simultaneously can OOM the WSL host ‚Äî batch edits,
build once, and expect interleaved commits (commit explicit paths only).

## 12e. The elements horizon (conjectures, operator-invited speculation)

Everything here is conjecture/reading unless a declaration is cited. The
shape of every entry: a place where the system already asserts something
about itself and the forcing theorem is visibly missing (¬ß12's rule).

- **The periodic table, period six.** ¬ß12d's census read chemically:
  coordination 6 = the closed shell (noble = flat = no charge to trade);
  the valence of a k-site is its deficit quantum; reactions occur only in
  neutral sectors (superselection, proved). The ionic bond is the 5‚Äì7
  dipole with its linear confining potential (`dipole_burgers_linear`).
  Mendeleev's periodicity would here be a THEOREM: the period of the
  table = the order of the fabric's local frame group ‚Äî 6 because
  hexagonal, not 8 because not ‚Ñù¬≥-with-spin. A claim about what "a
  period" is, made from outside chemistry.
- **The covalent bond is already proved and unnamed.** Theta graph:
  ground-state mass 1 < 2 = cycle rank (`theta_record_mass_below_rank`)
  ‚Äî one shared frustrated edge servicing two topological debts = the
  shared electron pair; binding energy = rank ‚àí mass. Conjecture:
  chemistry = optimization of shared frustration; a molecule is exactly
  a configuration whose record ground-state mass is strictly less than
  the sum of its parts', deficit = bond energy. Near-provable as a
  defined invariant plus a small atlas (PR, figure-eight, theta, KCBS
  pentagon).
- **Informational hydrogen, sharpened.** One geometry-protected nucleus
  (the unpaired five-site, ¬ß12d) holding one logic-protected satellite
  (a liar site, ¬ß7c) in the obstruction well (¬ß7b). Both stabilities and
  the well are green; the missing theorem is the bound state: total
  obstruction at finite separation strictly below the separated value,
  both charges conserved. The KCBS pentagon remains the minimal
  doubly-charged loop (one curvature quantum + one contextual quantum,
  ‚àö5 as the first spectral line).
- **Electricity: Kirchhoff is ƒåech, a battery is an H¬π class.** Current
  law = cocycle condition; voltage law = flatness, failing exactly on
  loops enclosing flux ‚Äî so EMF = Wilson-loop holonomy. Missing: the
  DUAL layer (currents/chains ‚Äî the library is all cohomology, no
  homology) and Thomson's principle (currents minimize dissipation),
  which is another descent-Lyapunov of the `obstruction_descent` shape
  on the dual complex. This is the earning path for the unearned
  Landauer name (¬ß10): dissipation = erased bits, and with ¬ß8's
  Bernoulli measure expectations exist to price it in kT¬∑ln 2.
- **The first law is missing and is nearly free.** `obstruction_descent`
  is only the second law (monotone decrease). Define per-stage
  dissipation = seps.sum ‚àí (slide seps).sum and prove obstruction plus
  accumulated dissipation is constant along the slide. Trivial
  bookkeeping, zero-axiom, provable immediately ‚Äî it converts
  "annihilation destroys energy" into "annihilation radiates ledger."
  Ranked first among these by proximity.
- **Chemistry: one flatness theorem, three coats.** CRN deficiency
  Œ¥ = complexes ‚àí linkage classes ‚àí rank is Euler-characteristic-shaped.
  Conjecture: deficiency is an H¬π of the reaction complex; the
  deficiency-zero theorem is a gluing theorem (complex balancing = every
  reaction loop flat). Then Wegscheider's conditions, Kirchhoff's
  voltage law, and gauge flatness are the SAME statement in three
  coefficient semirings ‚Äî the ¬ß11 coefficient-semiring schema with named
  physics as its instances. Catalysts = gauge transformations (conjugate
  the connection, change no holonomy: participate, shift no
  equilibrium).
- **The two absences under everything.** (1) INERTIA: the descent is
  gradient flow ‚Äî Aristotelian; no oscillation, no waves, no light.
  Conjecture: the record's counting multiplicity is the phase the charge
  shadow forgets; running dequantization backward (¬ß8) is where
  second-order dynamics comes from. The speed limit exists (¬ß7d's c);
  nothing yet propagates at it. (2) U(1): the gauge groups are ‚Ñ§/2 and
  ‚Ñ§/6; electromagnetism needs the circle. The house move exists: the
  dyadic tower earned the Cantor set (`dyadicHull_is_cantor`); the
