  paradox at the limit, exactly the shape
  `unattained_settling_gate` prices. The regime column classifies
  paradoxes: liar = strict/1-cycle, liar-cycles = longer 1-cycles,
  Yablo = œâ-escape, and ‚Äî
- **arbitration paradoxes are degree 2 and apparently unnamed**:
  three sentences, each PAIR jointly satisfiable, the three pairwise
