convention**. At each crossing, one thread passes over; a consistent
fabric-wide convention is a choice subject to constraints around
every face of the crossing complex. That constraint system is a ‚Ñ§/2
2-cocycle on the fabric's complex; a knitting pattern is a
trivialization; **a fabric whose convention cocycle is nonzero
cannot be knitted consistently** ‚Äî its miscrossings are not local
errors but the priced residue of a global degree-2 class. Theorem
