cocycle (that is what "plain" means); a twisted (M√∂bius-glued) patch
does not; the minimum ‚ä§-mass of a coloring of an unknittable fabric
equals a rank-type invariant of its H¬≤ class ‚Äî the degree-2 sibling
of `pr_top_h1_exchange`, on a carrier (bilattice-coloured weaves)
only this tree has formalized. This is the most in-house theorem the
staircase offers: the ‚ä§-ledger's first second-degree exchange rate,
about knitting.

### (g) The odometer's cohomology is computable, and the Bernoulli measure is a state on it

For Cantor minimal systems, the first cohomology of the ‚Ñ§-action
(equivalently of its mapping torus) is the **dimension group**; for
the dyadic odometer it is ‚Ñ§[1/2] ‚Äî the dyadic rationals, the same
