### (l) The staircase program, extraction-ranked

1. Discrete S¬≤ with nonzero H¬≤ (¬ß12i rank 1) ‚Äî the first hole.
2. Odometer H¬π = ‚Ñ§[1/2] at finite stages; Bernoulli as the state;
   unique ergodicity = unique state (welds ¬ß8, ¬ß7c-K-theory, ¬ß12i).
3. The knitting obstruction (f) ‚Äî the first degree-2 exchange rate,
   fully in-house.
4. GHZ as Massey (e) ‚Äî restate the ranked hypergraph program's
